reference[47]: "  [--resources TEXT] [--label key=value ...] [--adapter none|kind|k3d|compose]","  [--file PATH (required for compose)] [--key K] [--pending [--name HANDLE]]","  [--quiet | -q] [--axi | --json]","Owner defaults to DIBS_OWNER, then pid:<parent-pid>. pid and session pin","process start time; session:<holder-pid> follows a session-holding process,","not a Unix SID. heartbeat:<path> must already be a fresh regular file.",kind and k3d create uniquely named clusters; kind uses a private kubeconfig.,compose creates,a uniquely named project with a durable resolved config. none records metadata,only and performs no external cleanup. up is an alias.,"--key K: a retry with the same key and request returns status already_done.","With --pending or --key, --quiet prints only the lease ID (including on retry);",exit codes distinguish success from failure. --quiet cannot combine with --axi,or --json for those contract creates. Without these flags it keeps its usual behavior.,"--pending records the lease before the caller creates a kind, k3d or Compose",resource in the selected Docker context; the caller then stamps the label,io.dibs.lease=<id> or uses the handle pinned with --name (which must not exist,"yet), and runs dibs adopt <type> <handle> --pending <id>. Release and sweep","of a pending lease bind its single match first, so a crash still reclaims.","Statuses: created, recorded, already_done.","Examples:","  dibs create --owner pid:1234 --ttl 2h --resources '2 CPUs, test lab'","  dibs create --adapter kind --owner session:1234 --ttl 1h","  dibs create --adapter compose --file compose.yaml --label task=lab","  dibs create --adapter kind --pending --name lab-7 --key task-7:lab --quiet","",Touch heartbeat files at most every staleness/3. Extend a lease at the latest,when one third of its TTL remains. Owner death OR expiry makes a lease,"reclaimable: a live owner missing either cadence loses its resources.","Output: --axi for agents, --json for scripts (mutually exclusive).","Default: human on terminals; AXI for pipes or DIBS_AXI=1.","Lease commands: --full restores complete AXI records/text; JSON is always complete.","","Contract 1 (reconcile, reclaim, explain, extend, release, and --pending/--key):","exit 0 success with status; 1 operation failed, records retained; 2 usage;","3 refused, nothing changed, with a stable reason: not_found, wrong_machine,","not_pending, already_leased, key_conflict, handle_exists, handle_mismatch,","resource_absent, ambiguous, owner_alive, owner_unknown, expired, owner_dead,","job_deadline. Output carries contract: 1. See docs/consumer-contract.md.","","Exit codes: 0 success (including no-ops), 1 operation failed, 2 invalid usage.","dibs job: child's exit code on completion; 124 deadline killed child;",75 (EX_TEMPFAIL) no slot within wait. Dibs's own 1/2 apply only when no child,was started. Signal termination returns 128 + signal number. Helper/wait,failures after start use 125/126 and diagnostics on stderr.,76 is SSH transport/protocol failure with unknown remote result (stderr).,Child exit 255 is preserved and is not confused with SSH failure.
usage: "dibs create [--owner KIND:ID] [--ttl 8h] [--stale 15m]"
